{"bundle_id":"search.c34018b7bd59acf9bf62","facts":[{"description":"For the assessed office and services, at least one service constitutes a regulated activity under the applicable Ordinance after resolving applicable carve-outs. This is a supplied classification, not inferred solely from the family-office label.; units: Boolean classification","name":"regulated_services","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed office is carrying on a business in providing those services, determined from the case facts with Q3's listed considerations and qualified ordinary-course guidance retained. No single income, profit, or continuity consideration is treated here as automatically decisive.; units: Boolean classification","name":"services_as_business","type":"bool"},{"description":"The business providing those same services is carried on in Hong Kong, assessed on the relevant case facts. This is not merely the location of clients, investments, or shared premises.; units: Boolean territorial classification","name":"business_in_hong_kong","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.daa1876316641.u38.27681","s.daa1876316641.u18.26414","s.daa1876316641.u39.28171","s.daa1876316641.u40.28601","s.daa1876316641.u51.29888","s.daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: [TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected control only, true means the office satisfies all three stated conditions for Q3's licensing trigger: regulated services after carve-outs, carrying on a business in those services, and carrying on that business in Hong Kong. The tag denotes satisfaction of this trigger predicate; it does not mean that the office holds a required licence or complies with licensing law. Unknown classifications remain unknown."}],"rules":[{"body":{"args":[{"name":"regulated_services","node_id":"body.2","op":"fact"},{"name":"services_as_business","node_id":"body.3","op":"fact"},{"name":"business_in_hong_ko